{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102000","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102000/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102000/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102000/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102000","id":2810547962,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6nhY76","number":102000,"title":"RichTextLabel has no property for `line_spacing`, just `line_separation`","user":{"login":"AdamLearns","id":60950402,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTUwNDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60950402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamLearns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","color":"4466ff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-01-24T23:14:14Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T16:55:34Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in `v4.4.beta1.mono.official [d33da79d3]`\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS Sonoma 14.6.1\n\n### Issue description\n\n`RichTextLabel` has no `line_spacing` property, which would set the space only _between_ lines. Instead, it has `line_separation`, which adds that amount of space after _each_ line. E.g. in this picture, there is a lot of blank space below \"Line 3\":\n\n<img width=\"308\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f9eb18d-4894-4847-9818-8b0dad135af8\" />\n\nThe best workaround I could find is making a `FontVariation` that has `spacing_bottom` set to a negative value while keeping `line_separation` at a positive value. I believe this is similar to specifying the BBCode `[font bt=5]` but in such a way that you don't need to modify every `RichTextLabel` in your game.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Make a `RichTextLabel`\n- Increase its `line_separation` property to make it more obvious\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[richtextlabelspacingrepro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18543572/richtextlabelspacingrepro.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102000/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102000/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}